Type: Package
Package: rdborrow
Title: External Control Borrowing for Rare Disease Simulation and Analysis
Description: Implements causal inference methods for incorporating external
    controls in randomized controlled trials (RCTs) with longitudinal outcomes.
    Provides an Analysis module supporting weighting-based methods (IPW, AIPW),
    difference-in-differences (DID), and synthetic control approaches for
    external control borrowing, as well as a Simulation module for generating
    trial and external control data, evaluating estimator performance via
    Monte Carlo studies, and conducting power analysis for sample size
    determination. Built using S4 classes for an organized, extensible
    object-oriented design. Methods are based on Zhou et al. (2024)
    <doi:10.1093/biostatistics/kxae012> and Zhou et al. (2024)
    <doi:10.1080/01621459.2024.2395586>.
